# ============================================================================
# ANVESHAK .gitignore
# The public GitHub repo is a JUDGED ARTIFACT. Only reviewable engineering goes
# public: source code, schema, contracts, eval harness, README.
# Strategy, orchestration and demo choreography stay local-only.
# NOTE: these files still exist on disk (Claude Code reads them fine) — they are
# simply never staged. Back the private set up via the kit zip / private Drive.
# ============================================================================

